## IViewStartProvider

**Namespace**: `Cyrena.Contracts`
**Assembly**: `Cyrena.Components.Core`

### Purpose
Provides optional `ViewStart` entries for user-configurable starting views. Extensions implement this to add custom pages that users can select as their startup view.

### Interface Definition

```csharp
public interface IViewStartProvider
{
    IEnumerable<ViewStart> Provide();
}
```

### Methods

#### Provide()
Returns a collection of `ViewStart` entries representing available starting views.

```csharp
IEnumerable<ViewStart> Provide();
```

### ViewStart Model

```csharp
public sealed class ViewStart
{
    public string Href { get; set; } = default!;
    public string Title { get; set; } = default!;
    public string? Description { get; set; }
}
```

| Property | Type | Description |
|----------|------|-------------|
| `Href` | `string` | URL path for the view |
| `Title` | `string` | Display title |
| `Description` | `string?` | Optional description |

### Usage Example

```csharp
public class MyViewStartProvider : IViewStartProvider
{
    public IEnumerable<ViewStart> Provide()
    {
        yield return new ViewStart 
        { 
            Href = "/my-extension", 
            Title = "My Extension",
            Description = "Custom extension page"
        };
    }
}

// Register in extension
builder.Services.AddSingleton<IViewStartProvider, MyViewStartProvider>();
```

